435c4c2d-77c0-478c-ac4b-a4b8e05ff669	Building Your Maintenance Network	building-maintenance-network	Setup & Operations	National	USA	Build reliable vendor network with Fix it Brothers services and preventive maintenance schedules.	Building Your Maintenance Network\n\nReliable maintenance prevents bad reviews and protects profits.\n\nI. Essential Vendors\n• Handyman (general repairs) - $50-$80/hour\n• Plumber (emergency on-call) - $100-$150/hour\n• Electrician (emergency on-call) - $100-$150/hour\n• HVAC technician - $80-$120/hour\n• Locksmith (smart lock issues) - $75-$125/service\n• Appliance repair - $80-$120/service\n\nFix it Brothers (Austin, Charlotte, Tampa):\nUse fixitbrothers.net for professional handyman services specifically for STR operators. Sister company to Access Your Place.\n\nII. Finding Vendors\n• Thumbtack and TaskRabbit\n• Local Facebook groups\n• Yelp and Google reviews\n• Referrals from other hosts\n• Property management companies\n\nIII. Vendor Management\n• Get quotes from 3 vendors before major repairs\n• Require photos before and after work\n• Pay within 24 hours for priority service\n• Build relationships with reliable vendors\n• Keep backup vendors for each category\n\nIV. Preventive Maintenance Schedule\n\nMonthly:\n• HVAC filter replacement\n• Smoke/CO detector testing\n• Plumbing inspection (leaks, drips)\n\nQuarterly:\n• Deep clean (carpets, windows, appliances)\n• Exterior inspection (roof, gutters)\n• Appliance maintenance\n\nAnnually:\n• HVAC professional servicing\n• Water heater inspection\n• Pest control treatment\n• Safety equipment replacement\n\nV. Emergency Response Protocol\n1. Guest reports issue via message\n2. Assess severity (emergency vs. non-emergency)\n3. Contact appropriate vendor within 2 hours\n4. Provide ETA to guest\n5. Follow up after resolution\n6. Document for records\n\nCommon Emergencies:\n• No hot water → Water heater repair (2-4 hour response)\n• AC/Heat failure → HVAC repair (same day)\n• Plumbing leak → Plumber (1-2 hour response)\n• Lock malfunction → Locksmith or remote code reset\n• Appliance failure → Repair or replacement (24-48 hours)\n\nAccess Your Place maintains vendor networks in 64 cities for our clients.\n\nBook a call: https://calendly.com/investyourplaces	STR maintenance network: finding vendors, Fix it Brothers, preventive maintenance, emergency response.	["STR maintenance", "property maintenance", "Fix it Brothers", "handyman services"]	\N	\N	\N	\N	f	published	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	2025-12-01 14:10:28.056027+00	2025-12-01 14:10:28.056027+00	2025-12-01 14:10:28.02+00	\N
