mes near downtown ($1,600-$2,600/month)\n- Multi-bedroom properties for corporate housing ($2,200-$3,500/month)\n\n### Landlord Approach\n- Emphasize Tesla and tech worker demand\n- Highlight ski season and Lake Tahoe proximity\n- Show casino and convention tourism data\n- Offer 12-24 month leases\n- Provide comprehensive insurance coverage\n\n## Tax Obligations\n\n- **Washoe County Transient Lodging Tax**: 13%\n- **Nevada Sales Tax**: 4.6%\n- **Total**: 17.6% on gross rental income\n\n## Profitability Analysis\n\n**Example: 2BR Condo Midtown**\n- Monthly Rent: $1,700\n- Average Nightly Rate: $180\n- Occupancy: 72%\n- Monthly Revenue: $3,888\n- Net Profit: $1,500-$2,000/month\n\n## Getting Started\n\nAccess Your Place provides complete acquisition and setup services for Reno rental arbitrage operations. Our team handles licensing, furnishing, and launch for $2,500.\n\n**Contact**: hello@accessyourplace.com | Visit: deal.accessyourplace.com\n  	Complete guide to Reno Nevada short-term rental licensing, co-living regulations, and rental arbitrage opportunities in 2025.	["reno nevada str license", "nevada short term rental laws", "reno vacation rental permit", "co-living reno"]	\N	\N	\N	\N	f	published	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	2025-12-01 14:10:29.405605+00	2025-12-01 14:10:29.405605+00	2025-12-01 14:10:29.365+00	\N
