50b40a53-88fa-4320-ab6e-de0cd6037ad5	new_era_welcome	New Era Welcome Email (2026 Platform Launch)	Access Your Place is Live: The Amazon of Rental Arbitrage	<!DOCTYPE html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="UTF-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0"><title>Welcome to Access Your Place</title><style>body{font-family:Arial,sans-serif;line-height:1.6;color:#333;max-width:600px;margin:0 auto;padding:20px;background-color:#f8fafc}.container{background:white;border-radius:12px;padding:40px;box-shadow:0 4px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.1)}.logo{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#1e3a5f 0%,#2d5a87 100%);color:white;padding:20px;border-radius:12px 12px 0 0;margin:-40px -40px 30px -40px;text-align:center}.logo h1{color:#f59e0b;margin:0;font-size:28px}.logo p{color:#94a3b8;margin:5px 0 0 0}h2{color:#1e3a5f;margin-top:0}.feature{margin:15px 0;padding:15px;background:#f8fafc;border-radius:8px;border-left:4px solid #f59e0b}.feature h4{margin:0 0 5px 0;color:#1e3a5f}.feature p{margin:0;color:#64748b;font-size:14px}.cta-button{display:inline-block;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#f59e0b 0%,#d97706 100%);color:white;padding:16px 32px;text-decoration:none;border-radius:8px;font-weight:bold;font-size:16px;margin:20px 0}.footer{text-align:center;margin-top:30px;padding-top:20px;border-top:1px solid #e2e8f0;color:#64748b;font-size:14px}.highlight{background:#fef3c7;padding:2px 6px;border-radius:4px}</style></head><body><div class="container"><div class="logo"><h1>Access Your Place</h1><p>The Amazon of Rental Arbitrage</p></div><h2>Hello {{first_name}},</h2><p>Welcome to the future of property acquisition. Whether you have been with us since the <span class="highlight">Master Spaces era</span> or are discovering us for the first time, the landscape of rental arbitrage has changed forever.</p><p><strong>Access Your Place</strong> has officially launched its 2026 marketplace platform. We have moved beyond simple consulting into a massive, high-velocity ecosystem designed to make buying, selling, and trading arbitrage operations as easy as shopping on Amazon.</p><h3 style="color:#1e3a5f;margin-top:30px">Why Access Your Place?</h3><div class="feature"><h4>Penny AI Technology</h4><p>Our platform is powered by proprietary Penny AI, providing deep-dive market research, hotel occupancy cross-referencing, and revenue projections with unmatched precision.</p></div><div class="feature"><h4>Asset Tracking</h4><p>If you have previously acquired properties with our team, you can now add them directly to your Investor Portal to track performance and manage operations in one place.</p></div><div class="feature"><h4>Legacy Credit Honor</h4><p>For our long-term partners, if you held credits with Master Spaces, you can request those to be audited and added to your new account balance once you log in.</p></div><div class="feature"><h4>Turn-Key Launch</h4><p>From custom mood boards to professional photography and junk removal, our Setup Management team handles the Last Mile of your investment.</p></div><h3 style="color:#1e3a5f;margin-top:30px">Ready to Scale?</h3><p>Your new investor account is ready for activation. Log in now to explore premium vetted deals, analyze markets with Penny AI, and claim your existing assets.</p><div style="text-align:center"><a href="{{signup_link}}" class="cta-button">Activate Your Account and Log In</a></div><p style="text-align:center;color:#64748b;font-size:14px">Button not working? Copy this link: <a href="{{signup_link}}" style="color:#2563eb">{{signup_link}}</a></p><p style="margin-top:30px"><strong>Welcome to the family.</strong></p><p style="color:#1e3a5f;font-weight:bold">The Access Your Place Team</p><div class="footer"><p>Questions? Contact us at <a href="mailto:success@accessyourplace.com" style="color:#2563eb">success@accessyourplace.com</a></p><p>2026 Access Your Place. All rights reserved.</p></div></div></body></html>	Hello {{first_name}},\nWelcome to the future of property acquisition. Whether you have been with us since the Master Spaces era or are discovering us for the first time, the landscape of rental arbitrage has changed forever.\nAccess Your Place has officially launched its 2026 marketplace platform. We have moved beyond simple consulting into a massive, high-velocity ecosystem designed to make buying, selling, and trading arbitrage operations as easy as shopping on Amazon.\nWhy Access Your Place?\n* Penny AI Technology: Our platform is powered by proprietary Penny AI, providing deep-dive market research, hotel occupancy cross-referencing, and revenue projections with unmatched precision.\n* Asset Tracking: If you have previously acquired properties with our team, you can now add them directly to your Investor Portal to track performance and manage operations in one place.\n* Legacy Credit Honor: For our long-term partners, if you held credits with Master Spaces, you can request those to be audited and added to your new account balance once you log in.\n* Turn-Key Launch: From custom mood boards to professional photography and junk removal, our Setup Management team handles the Last Mile of your investment.\nReady to Scale?\nYour new investor account is ready for activation. Log in now to explore premium vetted deals, analyze markets with Penny AI, and claim your existing assets.\nActivate Your Account: {{signup_link}}\nWelcome to the family.\nThe Access Your Place Team\nQuestions? Contact us at success@accessyourplace.com\n2026 Access Your Place. All rights reserved.	New Era Welcome Email for 2026 platform launch - designed for both legacy Master Spaces investors and new users. Highlights Penny AI, Asset Tracking, Legacy Credit Honor, and Turn-Key Launch services.	first_name,signup_link	t	\N	2026-01-30 21:09:48.446006+00	2026-01-30 21:09:48.446006+00
